{"id":"G2296","lemma":"θαυμάζω","transliteration":"thaumazō","sayIt":"thaumazō","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to marvel","meaning":"θαυμάζω\n[in LXX for נָשָׂא, etc. ;]\nto marvel, wonder, wonder at: absol., Mat.8:10, 27 9:33 15:31 21:20 22:22 27:14, Mrk.5:20 15:5, Luk.1:21 (R, txt.; ICC, in l, but see infr.), Luk.1:63 8:25 11:14 24:41, Jhn.5:20 7:15, Act.2:7 4:13 13:41, Rev.17:7-8; with accusative of person(s), Luk.7:9; with accusative of thing(s), Luk.24:12 (WH, R, mg. om.), Jhn.5:28, Act.7:31; θαῦμα μέγα, Rev.17:6; πρόσωπον (LXX for פָּנִים נָשָׂא, Deu.10:17, al.), Ju 16; before διά, with accusative, Mrk.6:6, Jhn.7:21; before ἐν, with dative obj., Luk.1:21 (? R, mg., but see supr); before ἐπί, with dative of thing(s), Luk.2:33 4:22 9:43 20:26, Act.3:12; περί, Luk.2:18; ὀπίσω, Rev.13:3; ὅτι, Luk.11:38, Jhn.3:7 4:27, Gal.1:6; εἰ, Mrk.15:44, 1Jn.3:13. Pass. (Sir.38:3, Wis.8:11): before ἐν, with dative of person(s), 2Th.1:10 (cf. ἐκ-θαυμάζω).†\n(AS)","glosses":["amazed","marveled","amazement","surprised","wondering","all amazed"],"count":43,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-8","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"He marveled","kjv":"he marvelled"}},{"chapterId":"mat-8","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"were amazed","kjv":"marvelled"}},{"chapterId":"mat-9","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"were amazed","kjv":"marvelled"}},{"chapterId":"mat-15","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"was amazed","kjv":"wondered"}},{"chapterId":"mat-21","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"they marveled","kjv":"they marvelled"}},{"chapterId":"mat-22","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"they were amazed","kjv":"they marvelled"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"amazement","kjv":"marvelled"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-5","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"was amazed"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-6","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"He was amazed","kjv":"he marvelled"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-15","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"amazement"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-15","v":44,"renderings":{"bsb":"was surprised to hear","kjv":"marvelled"}},{"chapterId